<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>英文單字複習工具</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f4f6fb;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --primary: #4f6ef7;
    --primary-dark: #3b56d6;
    --danger: #e5534b;
    --ok: #2ea44f;
    --warn: #d9822b;
    --text: #22283a;
    --muted: #7a8199;
    --border: #e3e7f0;
    --bg: #f4f6fb; --card: #ffffff; --primary: #4f6ef7; --primary-dark: #3b56d6;
    --danger: #e5534b; --ok: #2ea44f; --warn: #d9822b; --text: #22283a;
    --muted: #7a8199; --border: #e3e7f0;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: "Segoe UI", "Microsoft JhengHei", "PingFang TC", sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px 60px; }
  header {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .stats { display: flex; gap: 10px; font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); }
  body { font-family: "Segoe UI", "Microsoft JhengHei", "PingFang TC", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; }
  .container { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px 60px; }
  header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .stats { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .stats b { color: var(--text); }
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .tab {
    flex: 1; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--card-bg); cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text);
  }
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tab { flex: 1; min-width: 110px; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--card); cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; }
  .tab.active { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); }
  .tab:hover:not(.active) { background: #eef1fd; }
  .panel { display: none; }
  .panel.active { display: block; }
  /* 翻卡模式 */
  .card-box { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(40,60,120,.06); }
  .card-box h3 { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .toolbar { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  select, button {
    font-family: inherit; font-size: .95rem; border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 8px 12px; background: #fff; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .spacer { flex: 1; }
  select, input[type=text], button { font-family: inherit; font-size: .95rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 8px 12px; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
  input[type=text] { cursor: text; }
  select:hover, button:hover { border-color: var(--primary); }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
  .btn-danger { background: var(--danger); color: #fff; border-color: var(--danger); }
  .btn-ok { background: var(--ok); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ok); }
  .spacer { flex: 1; }
  .progress-text { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .card-scene { perspective: 1200px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .card {
    position: relative; width: 100%; height: 300px;
    transform-style: preserve-3d; transition: transform .5s; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .card.flipped { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
  .card-face {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; backface-visibility: hidden;
    background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(40,60,120,.08);
  }
  .card-back { transform: rotateY(180deg); }
  .word { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .pos { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .meaning { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .example { font-size: 1rem; color: #444c66; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 560px; }
  .example-zh { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; margin-top: 10px; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: .8rem; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .badge.weak { background: #fdeceb; color: var(--danger); }
  .badge.new { background: #e8f5ec; color: var(--ok); }
  .speaker {
    border: none; background: none; font-size: 1.3rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--primary);
    padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .hint-text { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .form-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .form-row label { min-width: 70px; color: var(--muted); }
  .speaker { border: none; background: none; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--primary); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .speaker:hover { background: #eef1fd; }
  textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 150px; font-family: inherit; font-size: .92rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; resize: vertical; }
  .format-hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; margin: 8px 0; line-height: 1.8; }
  pre.format-hint { background: #f7f8fc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; overflow-x: auto; }
  code { background: #eef1fd; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .card-controls { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .card-controls button { min-width: 110px; padding: 10px 16px; }
  /* 學習模式 */
  .study-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 230px 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .study-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .word-chips { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; max-height: 520px; overflow-y: auto; }
  .chip { text-align: left; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: .95rem; }
  .chip:hover { border-color: var(--primary); }
  .chip.active { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); }
  .chip .chip-zh { display: block; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
  .chip.active .chip-zh { color: #dfe5ff; }
  .detail-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(40,60,120,.06); }
  .detail-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .detail-word { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .pos { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }
  .def-block { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .def-label { display: inline-block; font-size: .75rem; background: #eef1fd; color: var(--primary); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 10px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .exercise-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 14px 0; }
  .exercise-btns button.done { background: #e8f5ec; border-color: var(--ok); color: var(--ok); }
  /* 測驗模式 */
  .quiz-box {
    background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(40,60,120,.08);
  }
  .quiz-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--muted); }
  .quiz-word { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  .option { padding: 14px; font-size: 1.05rem; text-align: left; }
  .option.correct { background: #e8f5ec; border-color: var(--ok); color: var(--ok); }
  .option.wrong { background: #fdeceb; border-color: var(--danger); color: var(--danger); }
  .option:disabled { cursor: default; opacity: .9; }
  .quiz-result { text-align: center; padding: 30px 10px; }
  .quiz-result .score { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 10px 0; }
  .quiz-feedback { text-align: center; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 1.05rem; min-height: 1.5em; }
  .quiz-feedback.ok { color: var(--ok); }
  .quiz-feedback.bad { color: var(--danger); }
  /* 題目區 */
  .q-wrap { border-top: 1px dashed var(--border); padding-top: 14px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .q-type { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .q-hint { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .masked { font-family: Consolas, monospace; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); }
  .q-input-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .q-input { flex: 1; min-width: 180px; font-size: 1.05rem; padding: 10px 12px; }
  .q-word-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .q-word { font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .q-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .q-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .q-option { padding: 13px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; }
  .q-option.correct { background: #e8f5ec; border-color: var(--ok); color: var(--ok); }
  .q-option.wrong { background: #fdeceb; border-color: var(--danger); color: var(--danger); }
  .q-option:disabled { cursor: default; opacity: .92; }
  .q-sentence { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .q-sentence-zh { color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .q-feedback { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 1rem; min-height: 1.4em; line-height: 1.7; }
  .q-feedback.ok { color: var(--ok); }
  .q-feedback.bad { color: var(--danger); }
  .explain { margin-top: 10px; background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dfb8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; color: #6b5416; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .session-nav { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  /* 單字庫管理 */
  .manage-section { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .manage-section h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  textarea {
    width: 100%; min-height: 140px; font-family: inherit; font-size: .95rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; resize: vertical;
  }
  .format-hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; margin: 8px 0 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .word-list { max-height: 320px; overflow-y: auto; }
  .word-item {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .word-item .w { font-weight: 600; min-width: 130px; }
  .word-item .m { color: var(--muted); flex: 1; font-size: .92rem; }
  .word-item .tag { font-size: .75rem; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #eef1fd; color: var(--primary); }
  .word-item .tag.built-in { background: #f0f1f5; color: var(--muted); }
  .icon-btn { border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; padding: 4px 6px; border-radius: 6px; }
  .icon-btn:hover { background: #fdeceb; }
  .row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  /* 考核模式 */
  .exam-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .turn-badge { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 14px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .score-strip { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .score-pill { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: .85rem; background: #f7f8fc; }
  .score-pill.current { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; background: #eef1fd; }
  .exam-next { text-align: center; margin-top: 6px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  th, td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; }
  th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: .88rem; }
  .rank { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .card { height: 340px; }
    .word { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  }
  /* 錯題庫 */
  .bank-item { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .bank-head { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: .75rem; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .badge.study { background: #e8f5ec; color: var(--ok); }
  .badge.exam { background: #eef1fd; color: var(--primary); }
  .badge.type { background: #f0f1f5; color: var(--muted); }
  .bank-prompt { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 6px 0; line-height: 1.7; }
  .bank-ans { font-size: .92rem; margin-bottom: 6px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .bank-ans .wrong-ans { color: var(--danger); }
  .bank-ans .right-ans { color: var(--ok); }
  .bank-meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
  .bank-actions { margin-top: 10px; display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .empty { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); padding: 40px 0; }
  /* 單元管理 */
  .unit-block { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .unit-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .unit-head h4 { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .unit-words { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .unit-word { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: .88rem; background: #f7f8fc; }
  .icon-btn { border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: .95rem; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 6px; }
  .icon-btn:hover { background: #fdeceb; }
  #bankBadge { background: var(--danger); color: #fff; border-radius: 999px; padding: 1px 8px; font-size: .75rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <header>
    <h1>📖 英文單字複習工具</h1>
    <div class="stats">
      <span>單字總數 <b id="statTotal">0</b></span>
      <span>待加強 <b id="statWeak">0</b></span>
    </div>
    <h1>📚 英文單字複習工具</h1>
    <div class="stats">單元 <b id="statUnits">0</b> ・ 單字/詞組 <b id="statWords">0</b> ・ 錯題 <b id="statWrong">0</b></div>
  </header>
  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" data-tab="flashcard">抽認卡</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="quiz">測驗模式</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="manage">單字庫管理</button>
    <button class="tab active" data-tab="study">學習模式</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="exam">考核模式</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="bank">錯題庫 <span id="bankBadge" style="display:none"></span></button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="units">單元管理</button>
  </div>
  <!-- 抽認卡 -->
  <section class="panel active" id="panel-flashcard">
  <!-- ============ 學習模式 ============ -->
  <section class="panel active" id="panel-study">
    <div class="toolbar">
      <select id="deckFilter">
        <option value="all">全部單字</option>
        <option value="weak">只看待加強</option>
        <option value="new">只看新單字</option>
      </select>
      <div class="spacer"></div>
      <span class="progress-text" id="cardProgress"></span>
      <label class="hint-text">單元：</label>
      <select id="studyUnit"></select>
    </div>
    <div class="card-scene">
      <div class="card" id="card">
        <div class="card-face card-front">
          <span class="badge new" id="frontBadge"></span>
          <div class="word" id="frontWord"></div>
          <div class="pos" id="frontPos"></div>
          <div class="example" id="frontExample"></div>
          <button class="speaker" id="frontSpeak" title="播放發音">🔊</button>
          <div class="hint">點卡片翻面查看中文</div>
    <div class="study-layout">
      <div class="word-chips" id="studyWordList"></div>
      <div class="detail-card" id="studyDetail" style="display:none">
        <div class="detail-head">
          <span class="detail-word" id="dWord"></span>
          <button class="speaker" id="dSpeak" title="播放發音">🔊</button>
          <span class="pos" id="dPos"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-face card-back">
          <span class="badge weak" id="backBadge" style="visibility:hidden"></span>
          <div class="meaning" id="backMeaning"></div>
          <div class="example" id="backExample"></div>
          <div class="example-zh" id="backExampleZh"></div>
          <button class="speaker" id="backSpeak" title="播放發音">🔊</button>
          <div class="hint">再點一下翻回英文</div>
        <div class="def-block"><span class="def-label">中文解釋</span><div id="dZh"></div></div>
        <div class="def-block"><span class="def-label">英文解釋</span><div id="dEn" class="hint-text" style="font-size:1rem"></div></div>
        <div class="exercise-btns">
          <button data-ex="spellBlank" id="exBtn-spellBlank">✏️ 中間挖空拼寫</button>
          <button data-ex="spellFull" id="exBtn-spellFull">📝 全單詞拼寫</button>
          <button data-ex="cloze" id="exBtn-cloze">📖 完形填空 ×3</button>
        </div>
        <div id="studyArea"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-controls">
      <button id="btnPrev">← 上一張</button>
      <button id="btnShuffle">🔀 隨機排序</button>
      <button id="btnNext">下一張 →</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-controls" style="margin-top:10px">
      <button class="btn-ok" id="btnKnow">✓ 我認識</button>
      <button class="btn-danger" id="btnWeak">✗ 需要複習</button>
    </div>
    <div class="empty" id="studyEmpty" style="display:none">此單元還沒有單字，請先到「單元管理」新增。</div>
  </section>
  <!-- 測驗模式 -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-quiz">
    <div class="quiz-box" id="quizBox">
      <div id="quizStart">
        <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.8">
          測驗會從目前的單字庫中隨機抽出 10 題，<br>根據英文單字選出正確的中文意思。
        </p>
        <div style="text-align:center">
          <button class="btn-primary" id="btnStartQuiz">開始測驗</button>
        </div>
  <!-- ============ 考核模式 ============ -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-exam">
    <div class="card-box" id="examSetup">
      <h3>測驗設定</h3>
      <div class="form-row"><label>單元</label><select id="examUnit"></select></div>
      <div class="form-row"><label>參與人數</label>
        <select id="playerCount">
          <option value="1">1 人（單人）</option>
          <option value="2">2 人</option>
          <option value="3">3 人</option>
          <option value="4">4 人</option>
          <option value="5">5 人</option>
          <option value="6">6 人</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div id="quizPlay" style="display:none">
        <div class="quiz-head">
          <span id="quizCounter"></span>
          <span>得分：<b id="quizScore">0</b></span>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-word"><span id="quizWord"></span><button class="speaker" id="quizSpeak">🔊</button></div>
        <div class="options" id="quizOptions"></div>
        <div class="quiz-feedback" id="quizFeedback"></div>
      <div id="playerNames" style="margin-bottom:10px"></div>
      <p class="hint-text" style="margin-bottom:12px">
        每人 9 題：中間挖空拼寫 ×2、全單詞拼寫 ×2、中文解釋單選 ×1、英文解釋單選 ×1、完形填空 ×3。玩家輪流作答，答對一題得 10 分，測驗結束後公布排行榜。答錯的題目會自動收入錯題庫。
      </p>
      <button class="btn-primary" id="btnStartExam">開始考核</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-box" id="examPlay" style="display:none">
      <div class="exam-top">
        <span id="examProgress"></span>
